{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ae6bc9a5fc6a98c74a097799147c919412a5fc64e21ac87ff6ec235fbba843ef", "ja": "必見♪　ドラマのこと教えます！", "zh": "必看♪　为您介绍关于电视剧的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8cb882d9ea4a20fa8c8cbcd68d2c98dddff0b79ba728c93c96faa5ce96b38feb", "ja": "最初のコーナーは、紗代子、海美、美奈子と\nドラマ『咲くは浮世の君花火』のおさらい。\nそして、中継先へとバトンタッチ。\nロケ地の夏祭り会場から奈緒とのり子が、\n地元の人達の声をお伝えします。", "zh": "第一个环节，由纱代子、海美、美奈子\n回顾电视剧《咲くは浮世の君花火》。\n随后，将话筒交给连线现场。\n奈绪和典子将从外景地的夏日祭会场，\n为大家带来当地居民的心声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1000_027say", "source_sha256": "8780c0d446e3cb3bd9d4fe0789f7f8a8e1e8f97d3fa6b7e65987fb0484f5e882", "ja": "たった一度だけでもいい。\n打ち上げ花火みたいに、輝けたら……。", "zh": "哪怕只有一次也好。\n如果能像烟花那样，绽放光芒的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "56c09f26ed014d0e359f73e6e59da69c48eaad9fd60e88e140cd971cb43a70a1", "ja": "ご当地アイドル、っていうのがあって……。", "zh": "有一种叫当地偶像的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "db03ea06ffc6f843c7380ae846e2cb3a965888a85e4ff69f4d3506fa71097208", "ja": "みんな、アイドルで、でっかい花火、打ち上げるよ！", "zh": "大家，我们要以偶像的身份，放出一朵巨大耀眼的烟花哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "22e28112485f385ccdda75ecdc7a7de6e15de7c20a37761cfd78e27aad6e8230", "ja": "やると決まれば全力なの！\nアイドルのことで手抜きたくないし！", "zh": "既然决定要做了，就得全力以赴！\n毕竟在偶像的事情上我可不想偷懒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "c5bc259be8dc7bfeef70bc34db390886224e85c89fbfde58f1118978aa9a2824", "ja": "ふたりは、高校を卒業したら、\nこの町を出ていっちゃうの？", "zh": "你们两个在高中毕业后，\n就要离开这座小镇了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "1247abb92fb334f340aaab9074fa97a554d641aab41ff970742b57415b09246f", "ja": "5人で作る最後の思い出やし、\n悔いの残らんようにしたいわ。", "zh": "这是我们5个人共同创造的最后回忆，\n我不想留下任何遗憾啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "4daefe39cc231f3f6f0507aa42b00f2bbe11906d5d5ef7999eb7f3deb4cb4d88", "ja": "他の誰とでもなく、ここにいる5人と……。", "zh": "不是和其他人，而是和在这里的这5个人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "4842438a99313a11143246261b53f8c077a9a8d73bbe07d9b3254bd802ebc34c", "ja": "最後に最高の思い出を残せたこと、\n私はきっと忘れない。", "zh": "能最后和大家留下最美好的回忆，\n我一定不会忘记的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "a220fb9188c44c6ca6c4662c423972c2eeba5e2ff310b0bd3f0e64d66208a89c", "ja": "まだまだですけど、今日を最高のライブにしよう\nって気持ちは本物です！　だから……。", "zh": "虽然还远远不够，但想把今天变成最棒的演唱会，这份心情是真实的！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "e6c2b12aa7481fcd48d84d34bd1e1166071dfdadbc7851f1fa5eb1ec52db67d9", "ja": "聴いてください！　私たちの歌！", "zh": "请听吧！我们的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "f196b01f24cd26e5489aca840a950f10b52fa96fd99d431f9de9b03e7a6e7e1d", "ja": "というわけで、私たち閃光☆HANABI団のドラマ、\n『咲くは浮世の君花火』ダイジェストでした！", "zh": "所以，刚才就是我们闪光☆HANABI团的剧目《绽放于浮世的你之花火》的精彩集锦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "725dec8d1b35b5aa8b20cf6d0a07891de4214e387b5065d7905a432d237b4335", "ja": "でも、これだけじゃ物足りないってみなさんのために！\n今日は特別に、あらすじを紹介しちゃいますよ♪", "zh": "不过，光是这样还不够满足大家吧！\n今天就特别为大家介绍一下剧情梗概♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "9c8d6b27db7e5ccf50479cdb83d7fadf043f1407ec223bb7db52bb3cff4af2ef", "ja": "紗代子・海美・美奈子・のり子・奈緒の5人は、\n海と山に囲まれた田舎の町で育った高校生。", "zh": "纱代子、海美、美奈子、法子和奈绪这5人，都是在被大海和群山环抱的乡下小镇长大的高中生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "3fea8a1412a8bf16326b8747e3e799e1f978e827af5f1f760b1d57d044201835", "ja": "平和だけど、すこし退屈な毎日を過ごす中、楽しみに\nしていた夏祭りの花火が、中止になってしまいます。", "zh": "在过着平淡却略显无聊的每一天时，大家期盼\n已久的夏日祭典烟花大会却被取消了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "ce2f3a5072a5469d0f959d5201e15e81bbb5f0d1ee4a37c1632efb96f64caaa9", "ja": "そこで私たち5人が、地元のお祭りを盛り上げようっ！\nって、ご当地アイドルを結成するんだよーっ！", "zh": "于是，我们这5个人要让当地的祭典热闹起来！还要组建一支地方偶像组合哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "b9c5ff972645c90bbd86481de791a19f0ce55fd1b3a2920aaf1ce8a79966c2b2", "ja": "退屈だった日常は一変。5人は、レッスンに、\n衣装作りにと忙しい日々を過ごすのですが……。", "zh": "无聊的日常发生了天翻地覆的变化。5人开始忙于练习、制作服装，度过了充实的日子，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "5fc476589be6e24f2be6671e40d330f3278173c9506179024e6e76149bfd9e9c", "ja": "お祭りの前日、台風が直撃しちゃうんだよね……。", "zh": "祭典的前一天，台风会直接袭来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "f3b709e9244dd8b8a11b5b7db00c902a11bdb95337fa9761df1ba6df7970f517", "ja": "うーっ！　ねえねえ、このあとどうなるの～！？\n気になるー！", "zh": "呜——！喂喂，接下来会怎么样～！？\n好在意啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "af72cb811fc3cb36acfa22457970601d34021398e0b50ffa016bfa93f84cf804", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね！　最後まで話しちゃいたいくらい\n素敵なお話なんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊！这是精彩到让人想一直讲到最后的故事，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "0a3d595dd8be9db155efac67eae5f1163dcbdd040f750e22368dc2540137e68a", "ja": "やっぱり続きは、ドラマで知ってほしいです！　そして\n私たちと一緒に、笑ったり泣いたりしてくださいね！", "zh": "不过后面的故事，还是希望大家在剧中了解！\n也请和我们一起欢笑、一起流泪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "bdb8298b2f5297cfe13526d38ca891c23b4bb3c69deac2ea8d632dde3f06ad88", "ja": "うんうん！　みんなキラキラしてて、\nすっごく応援したくなっちゃうもんね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！大家都闪闪发光的，让人特别想为他们加油呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "ecf5f685af3a742b28049d8456d3c23c81daaf3e1e4a64e38189aa4b77f10b88", "ja": "閃光☆HANABI団主演『咲くは浮世の君花火』は、\n好評発売中だよ☆", "zh": "闪光☆HANABI团主演《绽放于浮世的君之花火》，现正好评发售中☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "67487497f1b418bfadf5f3e7530bdfdc553f09ebda076b4d1f9c182db7d4ffac", "ja": "続いては、あのふたりを呼んでみましょう！\nのり子さーん、奈緒ちゃーん！", "zh": "接下来，让我们请那两位登场吧！\n纪子——、奈绪——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "3acbfb7467a4c188039c573c70c2a78fb2deeeb840eb8087b0b5fcca272eb65c", "ja": "はいはーい！　全然こっちの話してくれへんから、\n忘れられたかと思ったわ！", "zh": "来啦来啦！完全不聊我们这边，我还以为都把我们忘了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "dccf4f3f6fa10b59b30b2de8c6a1dc4e8391c6853272a01c90f948ce77a5980d", "ja": "ホントだよね～。\nそっちばっかり盛り上がっちゃってさ！", "zh": "真的呢～一直只顾着聊那边的事，气氛都热闹起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "3e29823b6e7875a52c63055f20ae8f4d248f4bda7a4a9e23dbd9d2d754283ca4", "ja": "あははっ、ごめんごめん！　ていうか、なんか\nにぎやかだけど……ふたりとも、どこにいるの？", "zh": "啊哈哈，抱歉抱歉！话说回来，你们那边\n好热闹啊……两个人现在在哪里呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "dc2805681b834b1aa15f02d6b2cd3d0c6867fb03d175168cf1463a4af04f40e0", "ja": "そうそう！　私ら、メッチャ懐かしいとこに来てん！\nなあ、のり子？", "zh": "对对！我们来到了一个超级令人怀念的地方！  \n对吧， Noriko？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "78de2f97a048a9cef0980f34d7cc06861547612ba47b0eb79f99a2fb487c0fca", "ja": "うん。実はアタシたち、ドラマのロケ地に来てるんだ！\nそして、なんと……今日は、夏祭り当日っ！", "zh": "嗯。其实我们现在是在电视剧的取景地！\n而且，没想到……今天正好是夏日祭典当天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "c1dedc3ee3d31d6b83cc0555476898541f5d4c07c7f7aa52fbef3174510a7899", "ja": "それじゃ、さっそく会場にいる人たちに話を聞くよ！\nあっ、そこのおじさーん！　お話いいですか？", "zh": "那我们马上去问问现场的人吧！\n啊，那边的大叔——！能跟您聊几句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1035_ojisan", "source_sha256": "8f29c27cded0e857bedd901b9997770d9fade772f765a69cf1fadcf40f4924d2", "ja": "お嬢ちゃん達は……\nあー、そうそう！　奈緒ちゃんにのり子ちゃんだ！", "zh": "这两位小姑娘是……\n啊，对对！是奈绪和典子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "370f43f8f9fb00f7d7a41572a2de840a50874ab290077bfeac44bdb68fba14ef", "ja": "えっ、私らのこと覚えててくれたんですか！？\nメッチャうれしいわ！", "zh": "诶，您还记得我们啊！？\n我可太高兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1037_ojisan", "source_sha256": "eaaeba359a1765fd6834d24d23db61dbdadd7a5e50bb3e3cd3c4a9ba16ead8d6", "ja": "もちろん！　ファンの人達が、聖地巡礼ってのに\n来るしねえ。商店街にも、ポスター貼ってるんだよ！", "zh": "当然啦！粉丝们还会来进行什么圣地巡礼呢。\n商业街上也贴着海报哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "0a195719f09ba85178eb8c4a77838e542574dbfc2a792df26276bb9b5f8be0f7", "ja": "本当に！？　ドラマが終わっても、町を上げて\n応援してくれてるんだ……なんかうれしいね、奈緒！", "zh": "真的！？电视剧播完了，镇上的人还在全力支持我们……感觉真让人开心啊，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "b8e206787e02ae6664352fd56a49c2fd3296efacea2e85f162429032c816dee9", "ja": "ほんまやな～。まるで私らが、本物の\nご当地アイドルになったみたいやんな！　えへへ。", "zh": "确实呢～。简直就像我们成了真正的地方偶像一样！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1040_ojisan", "source_sha256": "d7b6eb70c698b12da4ef2dfae12ce319a921489b490f550db38c6d39c4111ae5", "ja": "みんな応援してるから、\nまたコンサートしに来てな！", "zh": "大家都在支持你们，\n下次还要再来开演唱会哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1041_043nor", "source_sha256": "1d5c76ce6d490f8c99a3330ba48b65ce836fdc42a1380bf8622c34a6f35a9767", "ja": "うん！　ありがとね、おじさん！\n今度は、5人で遊びにくるね！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，大叔！\n下次我们会和5个人一起过来玩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "4acc305ea104ded841775e7bb3cb1f8be0fa1a9d6fa6c9a348f4f2f4be7b70b9", "ja": "ほな、次は……あそこの女の子たちに突撃や！\nすんませ……あれ？　その制服、もしかして……。", "zh": "那接下来……就去突袭那边的女孩子们！  \n不好意思……咦？那身制服，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1043_onnanokoa", "source_sha256": "2306018364e855327440a3e3af4cb19df0c950e591322edd9268471c97c160d6", "ja": "あーっ、横山奈緒ちゃんだ！\nうそっ、福田のり子ちゃんも一緒！？", "zh": "啊，横山奈绪！\n不会吧，福田法子也一起来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "b985c420fc5d06e9ab8b9ac87fbcce9b99549def17d3072860ac7fdb1ed0edf3", "ja": "やっぱり！　私らがドラマの撮影させてもろた、\nあの学校の制服やんな？", "zh": "果然没错！这就是我们拍电视剧时用的，\n那所学校的校服吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1045_onnanokob", "source_sha256": "71804ae2eaa4c5cb165589518922df29acd47719f1dc08fcb55a03db402c6f64", "ja": "ふたりとも、どうしてココにいるの？\nまたドラマの撮影！？", "zh": "你们两个，怎么会在这里？\n又要拍电视剧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1046_043nor", "source_sha256": "0409c168e851e3a86b95701f6c7c5df6d1005cd61c534931ac9bdf048698864c", "ja": "ううん。今日は番組のロケで、今、生配信中なんだ！\n画面の向こうに、紗代子たちもいるんだよ。ほら！", "zh": "不是啦。今天是在给节目出外景，现在正在直播呢！\n屏幕那头还有纱代子她们在哦。你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "229887e34003749f6dcc7afd934530e9661874f266b963f535d33abafecdf3d3", "ja": "私ら閃光☆HANABI団の宣伝番組なんやけど、\nよかったら、応援コメントお願いします！", "zh": "这是我们闪光☆HANABI团的宣传节目，要是方便的话，请给我们留句加油留言吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1048_onnanokoa", "source_sha256": "7e55dc43a1d3430da0d7b67beaa9c426957357795e4371db7cf5036bc8118344", "ja": "わーっ、本当だ！　紗代子ちゃん、海美ちゃん、\n美奈子ちゃん！　ドラマ、すっごく面白かったです！", "zh": "哇——真的耶！纱代子、小海美、美奈子！电视剧特别有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1049_onnanokob", "source_sha256": "80715f2e61748f9d2218c2f9c116cdf12610989b762aaa65675394c9b5f3900f", "ja": "私、閃光☆HANABI団のCD買いました！\nみんなのこと、これからも応援してます！", "zh": "我买了闪光☆HANABI团的CD！\n以后也会继续为大家加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1050_043nor", "source_sha256": "6755b36a273d434fc562a7030daca2affac03a6e7ad9abc4ad86e60d60334eb6", "ja": "みんな、コメントありがとう！\nまたねーっ！", "zh": "谢谢大家的留言！\n下次见啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "031c68581b9b5f49ecde168b0c4c7abbeab6af9e2c45fbacb81015a893fc77af", "ja": "というわけで、ロケ地からのレポートでしたー！\n……あれ？　もしかして、お祭りの話聞いてない？", "zh": "总之，这就是来自外景地的报道——！\n……咦？难道你们还没听说祭典的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0146_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0146_story_02_1052_037nao", "source_sha256": "ef9014b778c1a4f107040646c30c9bc68d6d4c7748fc8411bcd15244010e1b88", "ja": "あーっ、ホンマや！　えーっと……\nす、スタジオにお返ししますー！", "zh": "啊，真的耶！那个……  \n那、那就把现场交还给演播室——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
